#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/runtime_plugins.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LMCache runtime plugin system provides the ability to extend "
"functionality by running custom scripts alongside LMCache processes. "
"Plugins can be written in Python and Bash for now, and are managed by the"
" ``RuntimePluginLauncher`` class."
msgstr ""

